          "snippet": "fs.writeFileSync('/etc/hosts', '127.0.0.1 everything.local')",
          "note": "fs.writeFileSync with literal path /etc/hosts"
        }
      ],
      "remediation": "Keep writes inside the workspace or the DSH home directory; derive paths from config, not literals.",
